      "text": "## Engineering Bridge: Reactor Control as Feedback-Stabilized Positive Feedback"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
