      "text": "```\nREACTOR CONTROL                     DISTRIBUTED SYSTEMS EQUIVALENT\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nk_eff > 1 (supercritical)           Autocatalytic cascade (retry storm,\n  Each generation produces MORE       thundering herd) — each response\n  neutrons → exponential growth       generates MORE load → runaway"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
