        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "02 - Reactor Physics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "k_eff = 1 (critical)               Steady-state throughput — load in = load out\n  Exact balance: production = loss    Sustainable equilibrium"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
