      },
      "text": "Negative feedback coefficients      Circuit breakers, backpressure\n  Doppler: fuel heats → σ_a rises    Load increases → circuit breaker opens\n  MTC: moderator heats → less mod.    Latency rises → backpressure signal\n  → k_eff drops automatically         → throughput drops automatically"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
