        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "02 - Reactor Physics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Delayed neutron fraction β_eff      Response margin above process time constant\n  β_eff = 0.65% of neutrons are      Without margin: control loop period < ms,\n  delayed by 0.2–55 seconds            no mechanical system can respond\n  → effective generation time ~100s   With margin: sufficient time for PID loop\n  → control rods can keep up            to adjust before instability\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:nuclear:02-reactor-physics, git-history:nuclear:02-reactor-physics]",
        "canonical_path": "nuclear/02-REACTOR-PHYSICS.md",
